1
01:14:36,912 --> 01:14:40,328
I believe that the fireplace in
this other room opens the same way.

2
01:14:42,573 --> 01:14:43,756
And it does.

3
01:14:46,496 --> 01:14:48,463
I tried to find this
but I couldn't find it.

4
01:14:48,493 --> 01:14:52,108
Yeah, it's back of this blueprint here.
Well, it's, it's quite a set up.

5
01:14:53,170 --> 01:14:55,669
Too bad we can't open
that safe the same way.

6
01:14:56,574 --> 01:15:00,206
Take an expert to crack
this box or a shot of nitro.

7
01:15:00,412 --> 01:15:02,359
Maybe, maybe that's
what the Bat had in mind.

8
01:15:02,389 --> 01:15:04,830
Could be, seems he's on the prowl tonight.

9
01:15:05,035 --> 01:15:07,449
Miss Van Gorder, Warner has disappeared.

10
01:15:07,479 --> 01:15:09,586
- Really?
- And Dr. Wells is been murdered.

11
01:15:10,226 --> 01:15:11,373
Dr. Wells?

12
01:15:11,639 --> 01:15:13,703
Lieutenant Anderson is
on that case right now.

13
01:15:14,028 --> 01:15:15,887
Oh, does he know what
happened here tonight?

14
01:15:15,917 --> 01:15:18,120
They got word to him,
he'll be here any minute.

15
01:15:29,467 --> 01:15:31,012
What's that noise?

16
01:15:31,893 --> 01:15:35,478
- Miss Van Gorder, the garage is on fire.
- Great scotch, look at that.

17
01:15:35,707 --> 01:15:37,868
Lizzie, put that light
out in the other room.

18
01:15:38,097 --> 01:15:39,244
Now, where are you going?

19
01:15:39,678 --> 01:15:42,044
- To report the fire.
- Well, you just stay right here.

20
01:15:42,074 --> 01:15:45,352
- But Miss Van Gorder, the garage?
- Well, let it burn, go watch the stairs.

21
01:15:45,695 --> 01:15:47,922
Can't you see that fire was
set to get us out of the house.

22
01:15:47,952 --> 01:15:52,316
- Out of the, you're talking about the...
- Yes, yes, I'm talking about the Bat.

23
01:15:52,619 --> 01:15:56,046
Now that the lights are out, he'll think
his trick has worked and we've gone.

24
01:15:56,076 --> 01:15:56,867
He'll be here any minute.

25
01:15:56,897 --> 01:15:58,297
Well, so will
Lieutenant Anderson.

26
01:15:58,321 --> 01:16:00,319
I hope so, but the
Bat will be here first.

27
01:16:00,349 --> 01:16:04,472
And he'll kill again if we're in his
way, we got to be as clever as he is.

28
01:17:16,714 --> 01:17:19,458
But you'll be safer
downstairs, I'll take care of him.

29
01:17:19,488 --> 01:17:21,523
Well, the others can go
but I'm going to stay right here.

30
01:17:21,839 --> 01:17:23,633
All right, but get out of sight.

31
01:17:50,226 --> 01:17:52,487
Let's face it ladies and get it over with.

32
01:17:53,211 --> 01:17:57,356
Others have seen my face before they died
but I'll have to deny you that pleasure.

33
01:17:57,974 --> 01:18:00,989
This would make a good scene
for your book Miss Van Gorder.

34
01:18:01,200 --> 01:18:03,673
But I'm afraid you'll never write it.

35
01:18:08,149 --> 01:18:12,099
That is Warner, I could tell.

36
01:18:15,823 --> 01:18:18,928
- You misjudge me Miss Ellen.
- Warner!

37
01:18:21,684 --> 01:18:24,597
I don't like being a murder
suspect Miss Van Gorder.

38
01:18:25,351 --> 01:18:29,904
I was headed for a plane but halfway to the
airport I changed my mind and came back.

39
01:18:30,809 --> 01:18:32,226
I'm glad that I did.

40
01:18:45,959 --> 01:18:48,191
Why, it's Lieutenant Anderson!

41
01:18:54,041 --> 01:18:55,699
Yes, it was Anderson.

42
01:18:57,055 --> 01:19:00,507
He discovered the secret of the hidden
room and was waiting to get into it...

43
01:19:01,035 --> 01:19:03,447
and open up the safe.

44
01:19:03,869 --> 01:19:09,040
We found the money in it, little over a
million in tens and twenties and hundreds.

45
01:19:12,266 --> 01:19:18,990
Good old Andy, with all his ill
gotten gains invested in bank stock.

46
01:19:19,881 --> 01:19:22,639
It's rather a clever
way to hide stolen money...

47
01:19:23,061 --> 01:19:27,508
in the open, as it were and so respectable.

48
01:19:29,137 --> 01:19:30,674
But don't try it.

49
01:19:31,911 --> 01:19:38,680
No matter how clever you
are, you can't hide murder.

50
01:19:45,511 --> 01:19:48,827
Well, that's it Dale.

51
01:19:49,687 --> 01:19:51,398
That's the end.
